--- a/public/admin/tool/mobile/UPGRADING.md
+++ b/public/admin/tool/mobile/UPGRADING.md
@@ -4,6 +4,9 @@
 
 ### Changed
 
+- A new mobile authentication setting, `tool_mobile/enabledeeplinkautologin` (disabled by default), has been added to explicitly allow auto-login via deep links passing the user token and privatetoken. The WS tool_mobile_get_public_config now always returns this setting as `tool_mobile_enabledeeplinkautologin`.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-88924](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-88924)
 - The WS tool_mobile_get_public_config now returns whether MFA and reCAPTCHA are enabled for login/recover password.
 
   For more information see [MDL-87003](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87003)
